India just became the 13th nation authorised to issue OIML certificates, and the government has issued 40 Government Approved Test Centre certificates to eligible private entities to expand verification capacity. This is your "why now" hook for the pitch — the country needs more labs producing OIML-grade reports right now, which is exactly what this tool accelerates. 
